## 5. Data Retention and Security

All data stored by ZenMix resides on your device. You can delete it at any time by uninstalling the app. We implement standard security practices to protect locally stored data, but no method of electronic storage is 100% secure.

## 6. Children's Privacy

ZenMix does not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. The app is designed for general audiences, including use for baby sleep sounds. If you believe a child has provided personal information through our app, please contact us and we will take appropriate steps.

